{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）上午9時54分，警方接獲報案，指已廢棄的金山石梨貝濾水廠有兩扇門及門鎖懷疑遭人破壞，濾水廠內多個銅製物件不翼而飛。案件列作盜竊，交由深水埗刑事調查隊第九隊跟進。</p><p>現場消息指，今早職員返回濾水廠時發現門鎖遭毀壞。經點算後，職員發現有48個水泵不翼而飛，損失金額共約1.4萬元。警方隨後翻查現場閉路電視，發現濾水廠近山邊位置設有一處門口，不排除賊人由此潛入作案。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場消息指，約48個水泵不翼而飛。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181218255407157248754619.jpeg/L6mtkKVQgrZ5ttPKqDamZfJaTVRJDTlqJvvFFAP7xRQ\"/><figcaption>現場消息指，約48個水泵不翼而飛。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場消息指，48個水泵不翼而飛。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181219167190126592528904.jpeg/FCeXGh5d4pLKXa4wkBJrPthAh40OEphJSTGk2mwxpNo\"/><figcaption>現場消息指，48個水泵不翼而飛。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210339639824384392576.jpeg/WTyUbBIkclNrWUkvYJMh61Uh4F1j14uyEd0pHDTdKRw\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210013767569408901582.jpeg/c1kP4fcx6iyLFc-mG0cYrffKSfq4uykrkpexALeXsQA\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210017550962688017362.jpeg/-aq-mzhySoD6Hx17l0_gE3nuvWj0m2XejKMnv6mjJ78\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場設有閉路電視。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210020654878720503267.jpeg/6hj9PpfuvhwuSfWnkahr45CS-9D_R9_AFvo5fDP6OXw\"/><figcaption>現場設有閉路電視。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是石梨貝濾水廠。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210023314198528587063.jpeg/pC_oZsV7DiHafz2s9fA01IDG22Msik2McM9xl1XPcZc\"/><figcaption>現場是石梨貝濾水廠。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是石梨貝濾水廠。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210027051454464270384.jpeg/29xe0onj4RfkD2qgngVon-FCWgxAhCPooo3rsYeN67E\"/><figcaption>現場是石梨貝濾水廠。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"門鎖懷疑遭人破壞。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210018863648768128430.jpeg/Fi_30oLs6HkfWSpOhI7EOyOkQvVfiXfmfiA5D1sgOQ8\"/><figcaption>門鎖懷疑遭人破壞。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"地上遺下黑色手套。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210022579933184518097.jpeg/4xfL-DsM58uXNflesmJVs5ZZ5m9r-LTIACWtbiUlrW4\"/><figcaption>地上遺下黑色手套。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"地上遺下工具。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210026875031552963840.jpeg/NH5B6-bYhp5EDOxDZSift6_ah1TLEQKVC7pv3i66b94\"/><figcaption>地上遺下工具。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"地上遺下士巴拿。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260928/1181210031258210304307298.jpeg/ZIUuAD6owRnxm0cPDagFVcZ9KOMamVDJ9yHEiNIhxIg\"/><figcaption>地上遺下士巴拿。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T07:19:13.771395+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":386,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}